OL,3,GNEWSASerial sex offender jailed for 17
OL,4,Ayears for catalogue of abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial sex offender who carried out
OL,7,Fhis first attack when he was 12 years
OL,8,Fold has been jailed for 17 years.
OL,10,FRyan Colquhoun's offences were
OL,11,Fcommitted in Wick, Thurso and villages
OL,12,Fin the Highlands between 2006 and 2020.
OL,14,FThe 31-year-old, formerly of Castletown
OL,15,Fin Caithness, admitted 10 offences -
OL,16,Fincluding rape, sexual assault and
OL,17,Findecent behaviour - before the case
OL,18,Fwent to trial.
